abstract: >-
  Processed fixed-delay survey statistics for 3027 frames and 32 conditions,
  frozen PCA parameters, reproducible analysis and plotting scripts, and six
  original representative frames. Code is separately licensed under MIT.
  This local preparation corresponds to manuscript V38; a public repository
  DOI and a paper DOI have not yet been assigned in this package.
